cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dvisor, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "dvisor: a progressive query engine for the browser"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-11
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/renato-mauro/dvisor"
url: "https://dvisor.io"
abstract: >-
  dvisor (Data Visualization Optimized Retrieval) is a progressive query
  engine that runs in the browser. It runs SQL queries against remote Parquet
  files with no backend server, and streams partial results as they arrive.
  The engine is written in Rust and compiled to WebAssembly.
keywords:
  - parquet
  - sql
  - query engine
  - progressive visual analytics
  - webassembly
  - data visualization
authors:
